</ul>
<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-4"><em>Sources: <a href="https://mistral.ai/news/ocr-4/" rel="nofollow" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Mistral API Docs / OCR 4 announcement</a>, <a href="https://docs.mistral.ai" rel="nofollow" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Mistral documentation</a>, <a href="https://tech-insider.org" rel="nofollow" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">TechInsider coverage</a>. Pricing and benchmark figures verified 2026-08-09.</em></p>`;
